00:46:45.240 --> 00:46:47.320
 typically the middle meningial artery

00:46:47.320 --> 00:46:49.160
 right under the temporal bone,

00:46:49.160 --> 00:46:51.560
 the thinnest part of the skull.

00:46:51.560 --> 00:46:53.360
 - Because it is arterial,

00:46:53.360 --> 00:46:55.840
 the blood is pumping out under massive systemic pressure

00:46:55.840 --> 00:46:57.160
 with every heartbeat.

00:46:57.160 --> 00:46:59.320
 - The hematoma expands rapidly,

00:46:59.320 --> 00:47:02.520
 violently stripping the dura away from the skull bone

00:47:02.520 --> 00:47:04.840
 and crushing the brain tissue inward.

00:47:04.840 --> 00:47:08.600
 - This precise anatomical setup creasy,

00:47:08.600 --> 00:47:10.080
 terrifying clinical presentation

00:47:10.080 --> 00:47:12.480
 called the lucid interval.

00:47:12.480 --> 00:47:14.160
 - Let's put you at the scene.

00:47:14.160 --> 00:47:15.960
 - A teenager gets hit in the side of the head

00:47:15.960 --> 00:47:18.520
 with a baseball bat or falls off a skateboard

00:47:18.520 --> 00:47:20.000
 without a helmet.

00:47:20.000 --> 00:47:23.720
 - The initial kinetic impact causes a brief concussion.

00:47:23.720 --> 00:47:26.360
 They get knocked unconscious for a minute or two.

00:47:26.360 --> 00:47:30.360
 But then they wake up, they open their eyes,

00:47:30.360 --> 00:47:32.680
 they know their name, they are walking around,

00:47:32.680 --> 00:47:35.120
 talking completely lucid.

00:47:35.120 --> 00:47:38.480
 - They insist they feel fine, maybe just a headache,

00:47:38.480 --> 00:47:40.680
 and they refuse to go to the hospital.

00:47:40.680 --> 00:47:42.520
 - But this is the trap.

00:47:42.520 --> 00:47:45.240
 During that perfectly lucid interval,

00:47:45.240 --> 00:47:47.720
 the torn artery is steadily pumping.

00:47:47.720 --> 00:47:49.400
 - The hematoma is expanding.

00:47:49.400 --> 00:47:52.120
 The pressure is building inside the rigid box.

00:47:52.120 --> 00:47:53.880
 - The brain is compensating,

00:47:53.880 --> 00:47:55.920
 shifting fluids around to make room,

00:47:55.920 --> 00:47:58.720
