00:47:58.720 --> 00:48:01.600
 - The compensation mechanisms fail completely.

00:48:01.600 --> 00:48:05.360
 The ICP spikes to fail levels, the brain herniates,

00:48:05.360 --> 00:48:06.720
 and the patient who was joking with you

00:48:06.720 --> 00:48:08.680
 10 minutes ago suddenly collapses,

00:48:08.680 --> 00:48:12.560
