00:49:45.360 --> 00:49:47.600
 - The first is decordicate posturing.

00:49:47.600 --> 00:49:51.200
 When pain is applied, the patient's arms flex inward,

00:49:51.200 --> 00:49:52.480
 wrists curled tight,

00:49:52.480 --> 00:49:55.760
