00:50:46.480 --> 00:50:50.680
 - Deceribrate is a much more ominous sign than decordicate.

00:50:50.680 --> 00:50:52.640
 - Trauma can crush the brain,

00:50:52.640 --> 00:50:54.680
 but trauma to the spinal cord introduces

00:50:54.680 --> 00:50:58.520
 a completely different kind of physiological horror.

00:50:58.520 --> 00:51:00.040
 - The brain might be perfectly healthy,

00:51:00.040 --> 00:51:03.240
 but the connection to the body is physically severed.

00:51:03.240 --> 00:51:04.880
 - This is why the absolute golden rule

00:51:04.880 --> 00:51:07.760
 of emergency medicine in the field is,

00:51:07.760 --> 00:51:08.960
 keep the spine straight.

00:51:08.960 --> 00:51:10.480
 - If someone falls from a ladder

00:51:10.480 --> 00:51:12.200
