00:51:16.560 --> 00:51:18.160
 with a cervical collar.

00:51:18.160 --> 00:51:20.080
 - Because if a vertebrae is fractured,

00:51:20.080 --> 00:51:22.440
 moving the neck even a fraction of an inch

00:51:22.440 --> 00:51:25.680
 can cause the jagged bone to slice like a guillotine

00:51:25.680 --> 00:51:27.600
 right through the delicate spinal cord.

00:51:27.600 --> 00:51:31.320
 - A momentary lapse in care can turn a temporary bone injury

00:51:31.320 --> 00:51:33.840
