00:55:59.680 --> 00:56:02.240
 What is the very first thing you do?

00:56:02.240 --> 00:56:04.640
 - You do not run to get blood pressure medication.

00:56:04.640 --> 00:56:06.120
 You use gravity.

00:56:06.120 --> 00:56:08.360
 - You immediately elevate the head of the bed

00:56:08.360 --> 00:56:10.760
 or sit them straight up at 90 degrees.

00:56:10.760 --> 00:56:11.600
 - By sitting them up,

00:56:11.600 --> 00:56:14.200
 you force the blood to pool in their legs against gravity,

00:56:14.200 --> 00:56:16.160
 instantly dropping the blood pressure in their head

00:56:16.160 --> 00:56:17.400
 to prevent a stroke.

00:56:17.400 --> 00:56:18.840
 - And once they are upright,

00:56:18.840 --> 00:56:20.680
 you go hunting for the trigger below the injury

00:56:20.680 --> 00:56:21.840
 to stop the civil war.

00:56:21.840 --> 00:56:23.360
